[[Black Channel Marsh]] is located in the southwestern [[Wetlands]]. It is mostly noted by travelers on the road to [[Menethil Harbor]], and inexperienced adventurers are advised to take care because the marsh holds numerous [[raptor]] lairs, and some of the hungrier beasts wander quite close to the road.

